a life back in the wild and ultimately the benefits they bring to this environment will be immense.
回归野生生活后，它们为这一环境带来的益处将极为巨大。

207
00:22:46,560 --> 00:22:52,720
All the wild elephants were poached out of this area in the 80s but the presence of this herd of
20世纪80年代，所有野生大象都从这一区域被猎杀殆尽，而这一群大象的存在则显得尤为珍贵。

208
00:22:52,720 --> 00:22:58,880
orphans will help to encourage the elephants back. They'll open up game trails and promote the growth
孤儿们将帮助鼓励大象回归。他们会开辟狩猎路径，促进其生长

209
00:22:58,880 --> 00:23:03,920
of grasslands making Ifumba a better place for all the Savo wildlife.
这些草地使得伊芬巴成为所有萨沃野生动物更好的栖息地。

210
00:23:07,200 --> 00:23:12,080
We've seen five little elephants move down here from the nursery in the last few months
在过去的几个月里，我们看到五只小象从育婴场搬到了这里。

211
00:23:12,080 --> 00:23:15,680
and it's great to know that they're all thriving in their new home.
很高兴知道它们在新家里都生活得很好。

212
00:23:15,680 --> 00:23:22,560
But I come out wondering how Luolani's little friend McKenna is getting on without her.
但我不禁好奇，没有露奥拉尼的朋友麦肯娜，她过得怎么样呢？

213
00:23:22,560 --> 00:23:28,080
Do you know I reckon Luolani leaving is the making of McKenna.
你知道，我觉得露奥拉尼的离开反而让麦肯娜变得更独立了。

214
00:23:28,080 --> 00:23:32,880
Suddenly she's realized that there's more to life than sucking Luolani's ear.
突然间，她意识到生活不仅仅是吮吸露奥拉尼的耳朵那么简单。

215
00:23:32,880 --> 00:23:37,520
She's become a lot more independent in the last couple of days you can see a lot more feisty.
在最近几天里，她变得更加独立了，你可以看到她更加有主见了。

216
00:23:37,520 --> 00:23:44,160
She's even beginning to mother little Chulu here. In fact I think that when it's her time
她甚至开始像母亲一样照顾小楚鲁了。事实上，我觉得当她有这个机会的时候

217
00:23:44,160 --> 00:23:50,400
she's going to be a fabulous little mini matriarch. McKenna is growing up quickly
她会成为一个非常出色的“小女族长”。麦肯纳成长得很快。

218
00:23:50,400 --> 00:23:52,480
and proving how resilient she is.
以及证明她的适应力有多强。

219
00:23:56,080 --> 00:24:02,080
But the little elephant who's made the most progress is Shimbah. He's bursting with energy
但进步最大的小象是Shimbah。他充满活力，

220
00:24:02,080 --> 00:24:07,760
out with the herd every day and sticking like glue to his neighbor and now adoptive mum Loijo.
每天都和群体一起行动，紧紧依附于他的邻居兼养母Loijo。

221
00:24:07,760 --> 00:24:13,840
Being the tiniest the keepers all adore him.
由于他极其微小，所有的守护者都崇拜他。

222
00:24:22,160 --> 00:24:28,880
But Shimbah is totally devoted to Loijo. Despite what he's been through
但辛巴对罗乔则完全忠诚。无论他经历了什么

223
00:24:28,880 --> 00:24:33,600
and the fact that he's only a couple of months old Shimbah loves to wrestle with some of the
而且它才几个月大，Shimbah喜欢与其中一些……

224
00:24:33,600 --> 00:24:39,520
bigger balls in the herd and if he's not rolling around with the boys then a roll in the dirt will
群中那些球更大，如果他不和伙伴们一起滚动，那在土里滚动也行。

225
00:24:39,520 --> 00:24:46,640
do just as well. But it's bedtime which says so much about how little Shimbah has fitted into
同样有效。但已经到睡觉时间了，这足以说明希姆巴所参与的活动实在很少。

226
00:24:46,640 --> 00:24:53,760
life with his new family of people and elephants. He's so attached to Loijo that he tries to sneak
他与新家庭以及那些大象们一起生活。他非常依赖洛乔，甚至试图偷偷溜进她的马厩里与她共度一夜，但这里的每个马厩里只能有一头大象。

227
00:24:53,760 --> 00:25:00,160
into her stable to spend the night with her but round here is strictly one elephant per stable
让她进入马厩里与她共度一夜，但这里严格规定每个马厩只能有一头大象。

228
00:25:00,160 --> 00:25:03,840
and Shimbah is tempted back to his own room with a warm bottle of milk.
辛巴被一杯温热的牛奶吸引，回到了自己的房间。

229
00:25:07,600 --> 00:25:18,880
But Loijo is only next door. She knows just how much he needs her and she's there to reassure Shimbah
但洛乔就在隔壁。她知道他需要多少帮助，她就在那里，让辛巴安心。

230
00:25:18,880 --> 00:25:27,680
as he settles down for the night. The keepers tuck him in as gently as possible.
当他准备入睡时，看护人尽可能轻柔地把他盖好。

231
00:25:27,680 --> 00:25:34,240
This little one needs every bit of sleep he can get. Considering that he's been through the
这个小家伙需要尽可能多地睡觉。考虑到他已经经历了……

232
00:25:34,240 --> 00:25:40,960
horror of seeing his mum die at such a young age this is as close as Shimbah could get to a happy ending.
看到母亲在如此年轻的年纪去世，这种恐惧是辛巴哈所能达到的最接近圆满结局的情况了。

233
00:25:40,960 --> 00:25:47,520
And Loijo gently soothes him off into a deep sleep.
洛乔温柔地让他进入深度睡眠。

234
00:25:47,520 --> 00:26:00,480
It's heartwarming to see how well Shimbah is getting on but these are still dangerous times
看到辛巴的情况有所改善真是令人欣慰，但当前仍属于危险时期。

235
00:26:00,480 --> 00:26:06,160
for all Africa's elephants with ivory poaching on the increase and pressure on land from human
对于整个非洲的大象来说，象牙偷猎现象日益严重，人类对土地的压力也越来越大。

236
00:26:06,160 --> 00:26:13,600
settlement but there is hope and for little Shimbah and all the other orphans there is a real chance
虽然情况糟糕，但仍有希望。对于小辛巴和那里所有的孤儿来说，真的有机会。

237
00:26:13,600 --> 00:26:21,920
for a life back among the wild herds of Savo. It just makes you feel wonderful to be alive to see
能重新回到萨沃的野生兽群中生活。看到自己还活着，真是令人欣慰。

238
00:26:21,920 --> 00:26:28,960
tiny little baby elephants wild elephants with their mothers relaxed within the herd able to drink
小象宝宝们与母亲一起在兽群中休息，能够饮水。

239
00:26:28,960 --> 00:26:35,760
able to socialize because you think about the lives of our orphans that led where they came from
它们能够社交，因为你会想到那些孤儿们曾经的生活，以及他们来自哪里。

240
00:26:35,760 --> 00:26:41,120
many of them orphaned losing their mothers when they were just a few days old a few weeks old
许多孤儿在只有几天或几周大时就失去了母亲。

241
00:26:41,120 --> 00:26:48,400
imagine the trauma that they must have felt but they have got a second chance the females will come
想象一下它们所经历的创伤，不过现在它们有了第二次机会，雌性动物会出现的。

242
00:26:48,400 --> 00:26:55,040
back to the wild and hopefully will have their own calves it's happened already and this is the
回到野外，希望它们能拥有自己的幼崽——这种情况已经发生过了，这就是……

243
00:26:55,040 --> 00:27:00,400
point of the whole thing the cycle coming full circle the orphans going back to the wild
关键在于这个循环会回到原点，那些孤儿会再次回到野外。

244
00:27:00,400 --> 00:27:06,400
we know that it can work this is the future for the orphans and it's a wild future
我们知道这确实可行，这是孤儿们的未来，而那是一个充满野性的未来。

245
00:27:06,400 --> 00:27:14,640
of course not all the elephants that get orphaned in the wild get found and rescued
当然，并非所有在野外成为孤儿的大象都能被找到并得到救助。

246
00:27:14,640 --> 00:27:21,680
even those that do sadly as we've seen sometimes don't make it these little babies represent the
即使那些不幸的，正如我们有时看到的那样，也无法成功。这些小生命代表着那些有幸得到第二次机会的人，他们拥有充足的时间、爱、奉献精神以及耐心。

247
00:27:21,680 --> 00:27:29,760
lucky ones the ones that are given a second chance with plenty of time love dedication and patience
幸运的人，那些得到第二次机会的人，他们拥有充足的时间、爱、奉献精神与耐心

248
00:27:29,760 --> 00:27:32,160
their fate can be turned around
他们的命运可以被扭转

249
00:27:32,160 --> 00:27:40,160
it's been an incredible year here at the david shoulder at wildlife trust
在野生动物信托组织的戴维·肖尔基地，这一年真是不可思议

250
00:27:40,160 --> 00:27:46,640
seeing all the elephants come and go growing changing having fun making friends and learning
看着那些大象来来去去，不断成长、变化，享受着乐趣，结交朋友，学习知识

251
00:27:46,640 --> 00:27:53,120
how to live in the wild elephants like wendy who struggled with an identity crisis
如何像温迪那样，与身份危机作斗争的野生大象生活

252
00:27:53,120 --> 00:28:00,640
little blind undolomo who lost his fight for life mckenna who was so deeply devoted to
失去生命斗争的小盲眼乌多洛莫，麦肯纳对它如此深爱着

253
00:28:00,640 --> 00:28:08,400
lewolani but coped so well with her separation and emily who showed us just how successful life in
莱沃拉尼却很好地应对了与她的分离，艾米丽则向我们展示了生活究竟有多么成功

254
00:28:08,400 --> 00:28:16,240
the wild can be the loveliest creature all this is made possible by daphne shoulder
野象可能是最可爱的生物，这一切都得益于达芙妮·肖尔的付出。

255
00:28:16,240 --> 00:28:18,720
and her team have dedicated keepers
她的团队也有专业的照顾者。

256
00:28:18,720 --> 00:28:25,760
the work here with the orphans is ongoing and as long as there are baby elephants in need
对孤儿们的照顾工作仍在继续，只要还有需要帮助的小象存在，就会继续开展这项工作。

257
00:28:25,760 --> 00:28:40,720
there will be a home and a family for them here
他们在这里将拥有家与家庭。
